WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.696 --> 00:00:07.601
Tonight, somewhere in Europe, a drone that cost about thirty-five thousand dollars is flying towards a power station.

2
00:00:08.147 --> 00:00:12.358
Too often, the answer is a missile costing over a hundred times more.

3
00:00:12.396 --> 00:00:19.942
In the first two days of the 2026 Gulf conflict, defenders are estimated to have spent up to two point three billion dollars on interceptors.

4
00:00:20.489 --> 00:00:22.744
Defenders are not losing on skill.

5
00:00:22.751 --> 00:00:24.481
They are losing on cost.

6
00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:27.430
The threat is cheap, and it changes every month.

7
00:00:28.055 --> 00:00:34.724
Aegis Stratos builds Physical AI to protect people and critical infrastructure, at a price defenders can sustain.

8
00:00:35.335 --> 00:00:37.405
One platform, one brain.

9
00:00:37.477 --> 00:00:39.880
Metatron, to watch and to search.

10
00:00:39.958 --> 00:00:43.876
Mjolnir, an interceptor built to fly home when it is not used.

11
00:00:43.956 --> 00:00:48.752
Keraunos, designed to stop jet-powered drones for around fifteen thousand dollars.

12
00:00:48.792 --> 00:00:51.958
Keraunos NATO, hardened for the hardest threats.

13
00:00:52.078 --> 00:00:55.478
And Intelligence, the flight AI built to fly them all.

14
00:00:56.137 --> 00:00:57.928
We are AI-native.

15
00:00:57.977 --> 00:01:01.622
The AI came first, and the aircraft are designed around it.

16
00:01:01.702 --> 00:01:04.930
AI drafts, tests and documents every part.

17
00:01:05.050 --> 00:01:06.657
People approve every step.

18
00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:09.444
Our goal is new capability every eight weeks.

19
00:01:09.990 --> 00:01:13.851
For the defender, that means protection you can afford to keep using.

20
00:01:13.989 --> 00:01:17.665
Interceptors priced against the threat, not against a missile.

21
00:01:17.745 --> 00:01:20.121
Aircraft that come home and fly again.

22
00:01:20.401 --> 00:01:21.434
Designed in Britain.

23
00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:28.885
And the same brain goes further: the defence of public spaces, robots for hazardous work, and our own AI models.

24
00:01:29.724 --> 00:01:30.544
Flying today.

25
00:01:30.655 --> 00:01:32.082
Field trials next.

26
00:01:32.255 --> 00:01:33.649
AI for peace.

27
00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:34.889
Built for protection.
